      "updated": 1785754002
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7071910000000000f6113c",
      "text": "https://www.daltonmaag.com/font-library/darkmode.html",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785754002,
      "updated": 1785754007
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7071970000000000f6113e",
      "text": "> Darkmode is a highly legible humanist sans typeface for modern UIs. Weight and Italic variable font axes deliver clear visual hierarchy; the Darkmode axis counteracts the Irradiation Illusion, ensuring consistency regardless of contrast between text and background.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785754008,
      "updated": 1785754031
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7072ae0000000000481348",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785754287,
      "updated": 1785754287
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7072d5000000000048134a",
      "text": " 背景とのコントラストに応じて[イラディエーション錯視]を打ち消すことを目的とした専用軸（[\" the [Darkmode axis]]）が導入されているフォント",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785754326,
      "updated": 1785754591
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7072ae0000000000481349",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1785754287,
      "updated": 1785754287
    },
    {
